      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it is the goal of the City of New York to provide and promote prevention and treatment services and programs, while also advancing the range of policies needed to take on the structural issues at the root of many mental health conditions; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
